        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;" value="Notes&#xa;1. This ERD represents the current Phase 1 database structure.&#xa;2. tbl_gap_analyses stores an analysis run; tbl_gap_analysis_results stores competency-level results for that run.&#xa;3. tbl_behavioral_indicators links a competency to a proficiency level and stores the indicator text.&#xa;4. required_level, current_level and gap_level are integer level values in the current schema.&#xa;5. Historical records are retained separately for audit/history tracking.&#xa;6. Assessment, Training &amp; Development, IDP and Talent/Succession functionality are excluded from Phase 1." vertex="1">
